/* 窄屏（1366 一档）小读数三格：格内左右边距 5 → 3 px、标签与说明缩进 6 → 4 px，字的可用宽每格多 6 px（约 8 %）。
   10-28 ⑪ 加 0.92 余量后 18 门在 1366 下贴边红，外壳一处收，免得各课改字（项目负责 03:0x）。放在紧凑档之后，覆盖它的 padding */
@media (max-width:1500px){
  .subs .sub{padding-left:3px;padding-right:3px}
  .sub .lb,.sub .cal{padding-left:4px}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{transition:none !important;animation:none !important}}
@supports not ((backdrop-filter:blur(1px)) or (-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(1px))){
  #top,#steps,#foot,#left,#right,#secview,#eqb,.lab,.anno,.btn,.cdbox,#toast{background:var(--glass-back)}
}
/* 自适应降级：运行时连续约 2 s 低于 30 fps，外壳给 body 加 lowfps（index.js watchFps）。面板纯底 0.92、不做背景模糊 */
body.lowfps *{backdrop-filter:none!important;-webkit-backdrop-filter:none!important}
body.lowfps #top,body.lowfps #steps,body.lowfps #foot,body.lowfps #left,body.lowfps #right,body.lowfps #secview,
body.lowfps .cdbox,body.lowfps #toast{background:var(--glass-solid)}   /* 只换大面板的底；按钮、名牌、横幅保留各自的底色（.btn.pri、.lab.sel 等） */
@media (prefers-reduced-transparency:reduce){
  #top,#steps,#foot,#left,#right,#secview,#eqb,.lab,.anno,.btn,.cdbox,#toast{background:var(--glass-back);backdrop-filter:none;-webkit-backdrop-filter:none}
}

/* ============================================================================
   shared/screen/section.css · 剖面组件的面板语言
   四档字号：28（主读数）/ 20（次读数）/ 13.5（标题、讲解）/ 12（口径、图例、标注）
   白卡：圆角 14、1px 边框、极轻阴影；一色一义图例：琥珀=温度 / 青=气流 / 红=越界
   ========================================================================== */
.sec{
  --s-ink:#1d2b31; --s-ink2:#54666e; --s-line:#d7e2e7;
  --s-amber:#e08a1e; --s-teal:#0d7a8c; --s-red:#c0392b;
  display:flex; flex-direction:column; height:100%; min-height:0; width:100%;
  font-family:-apple-system,"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",system-ui,sans-serif;
  color:var(--s-ink); font-size:12px; background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fbfdfe 0%,#eef4f6 60%,#e9eff2 100%);
  border-radius:14px; overflow:hidden;
}
.sec *{box-sizing:border-box}
.sec [hidden]{display:none !important}
.sec button{font:inherit;color:inherit}

/* ---------------- 顶栏 ---------------- */
.sec-bar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:5px 10px 5px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(215,226,231,.9);background:rgba(255,255,255,.72)}
.sec-ttl{font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.sec-ttl span{font-size:12px;font-weight:400;color:var(--s-ink2);margin-left:6px}
.sec-tabs{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-left:auto}
.sec-tabs button{font-size:12px;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:9px;border:1px solid var(--s-line);background:#fff;color:var(--s-ink2);cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}
.sec-tabs button.on{background:#e9f4f6;border-color:#b7d6dd;color:#0b5f6d;font-weight:600}

/* ---------------- 舞台 ---------------- */
.sec-stage{position:relative;flex:1 1 auto;min-height:180px;overflow:hidden}
.sec-cv{display:block;width:100%;height:100%}
.sec-ov,.sec-ld{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none}
.sec-ov{z-index:2} .sec-ld{z-index:4}
.sec-lab{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;z-index:5;font-size:12px;line-height:1.2;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:6px;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.95);border:1px solid var(--s-line);box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(20,40,50,.08);white-space:nowrap;transition:opacity .15s}

/* 叠加层开关（不是读数胶囊） */
.sec-togs{position:absolute;z-index:3;left:8px;top:6px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;
  font-size:12px;color:var(--s-ink2);background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);border:1px solid var(--s-line);
  border-radius:9px;padding:3px 8px}
.sec-togs .sec-tog{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}
.sec-togs input{margin:0;accent-color:var(--s-teal);width:12px;height:12px}
.sec-apartbar{position:absolute;z-index:3;right:8px;top:6px;display:flex;gap:4px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;
  font-size:12px;color:var(--s-ink2);background:rgba(255,255,255,.92);border:1px solid var(--s-line);
  border-radius:9px;padding:3px 8px;max-width:calc(100% - 16px)}
.sec-apartbar b{color:var(--s-ink);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:13.5px}
.sec-apartbar i{font-style:normal;color:#b6c5cb}
.sec-alarm{position:absolute;z-index:3;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);top:6px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;
  color:#fff;background:var(--s-red);border-radius:8px;padding:3px 9px;display:none;white-space:nowrap}
.sec-alarm.on{display:block}

/* 讲义图页 */
.sec-sheet{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:8;background:#fff;display:none;overflow:auto}
.sec-sheet.on{display:block}
.sec-sheetwrap{padding:6px 8px 6px}
.sec-sheet-hd{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;font-size:12px;color:var(--s-ink2)}
.sec-sheet-hd b{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--s-ink)}
.sec-sheet svg{display:block;width:100%;max-width:880px;height:auto;margin:0 auto}
.sec-sheet-read{margin-top:4px;font-size:12px;color:var(--s-ink2)}
.sec-sheet-read b{color:var(--s-ink);font-size:13.5px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.sec-sheet-note{margin-top:2px;font-size:12px;color:var(--s-ink2)}
.sec-sheet-none{padding:24px;text-align:center;color:var(--s-ink2)}

/* ---------------- 读数卡 ---------------- */
.sec-read{border-top:1px solid var(--s-line);background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);padding:5px 10px 5px;border-radius:14px}
.sec-row{display:flex;gap:12px}
.sec-cell{flex:1;min-width:0}
.sec-k{font-size:12px;color:var(--s-ink2)}
.sec-v{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:2px}
.sec-v b{font-size:28px;line-height:1.05;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;letter-spacing:-.5px}
.sec-cell.hot .sec-v b{color:#b8710f}
.sec-v i{font-size:12px;color:var(--s-ink2);font-style:normal}
.sec-cap{font-size:12px;color:var(--s-ink2);line-height:1.2}
.sec-basis{margin-top:2px;font-size:12px;color:var(--s-ink2);line-height:1.25}

/* ---------------- 温度滑杆 ---------------- */
.sec-ctrl{border-top:1px solid var(--s-line);background:rgba(255,255,255,.75);padding:2px 10px 3px}
.sec-top{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--s-ink2);white-space:nowrap}
.sec-top .sec-tval{margin-left:auto;color:var(--s-ink);font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:13.5px}
.sec-top .sec-hint{color:#8aa0a9}
.sec-temp{width:100%;margin:0;accent-color:var(--s-teal);height:15px}

/* ---------------- 说话区 + 图例 ---------------- */
.sec-duo{display:flex;border-top:1px solid var(--s-line)}
.sec-voice{flex:1 1 300px;min-width:0;padding:4px 10px 4px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.55)}
.sec-legend{flex:1 1 280px;padding:4px 8px 4px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.7);border-left:1px solid var(--s-line)}
.sec-li{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:6px;font-size:12px;color:var(--s-ink2);line-height:1.25}
.sec-sw{width:14px;height:9px;margin-top:2px;border-radius:2px;flex:none;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.12)}
.sec-say{font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.32}
.sec-idx{color:#0b5f6d;font-weight:600;margin-right:4px}
.sec-nav{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:3px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.sec-nav button{font-size:12px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--s-line);background:#fff;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}
.sec-nav button.on{background:#e9f4f6;border-color:#b7d6dd;color:#0b5f6d;font-weight:600}
.sec-intent,.sec-aparttag{font-size:12px;color:var(--s-ink2);margin-left:auto}
.sec-tip{font-size:12px;color:var(--s-ink2);line-height:1.3;margin-top:2px}
.sec-lbox{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1px}

/* ---------------- 宽画幅：右栏 ---------------- */
.sec[data-layout="wide"]{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 372px;grid-template-rows:auto 1fr auto auto auto;
  grid-template-areas:"bar bar" "stage read" "stage ctrl" "stage duo"}
.sec[data-layout="wide"] .sec-bar{grid-area:bar}
.sec[data-layout="wide"] .sec-stage{grid-area:stage}
.sec[data-layout="wide"] .sec-read{grid-area:read;align-self:start;border-top:0;border-left:1px solid var(--s-line);
  border-radius:0;background:rgba(255,255,255,.9)}
.sec[data-layout="wide"] .sec-ctrl{grid-area:ctrl;border-left:1px solid var(--s-line)}
.sec[data-layout="wide"] .sec-duo{grid-area:duo}
.sec[data-layout="wide"] .sec-row{flex-direction:column;gap:3px}
.sec[data-layout="wide"] .sec-cell{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px}
.sec[data-layout="wide"] .sec-k{width:66px;flex:none}
.sec[data-layout="wide"] .sec-v b{font-size:20px}
.sec[data-layout="wide"] .sec-cap{flex:1;min-width:0}
.sec[data-layout="wide"] .sec-duo{flex-direction:column;border-left:1px solid var(--s-line)}
.sec[data-layout="wide"] .sec-legend{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid var(--s-line)}
.sec[data-layout="wide"] .sec-togs{left:10px;top:8px}

/* ---------------- 嵌入课程面板的紧凑档（chrome="lean"） ---------------- */
.sec[data-chrome="lean"] .sec-bar{padding:3px 8px 3px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.5)}
.sec[data-chrome="lean"] .sec-bar .sec-ttl{display:none}
.sec[data-chrome="lean"] .sec-tabs{margin-left:0}
.sec[data-chrome="lean"] .sec-tabs button{padding:3px 7px}
.sec[data-chrome="lean"] .sec-voice{min-height:72px}
.sec[data-chrome="lean"] .sec-lbox{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px 8px}
.sec[data-chrome="lean"] .sec-read{padding:4px 8px 4px}
.sec[data-chrome="lean"] .sec-v b{font-size:20px}
.sec[data-chrome="lean"] .sec-stage{min-height:240px}
.sec.sec-lean .sec-stage .sec-legend{position:absolute;left:6px;bottom:6px;z-index:6;width:44%;max-width:300px;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.92);border:1px solid var(--s-line);border-radius:9px;padding:3px 7px;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(20,40,50,.06)}
.sec.sec-lean .sec-stage .sec-legend .sec-lbox{grid-template-columns:1fr}
.sec.sec-lean .sec-duo{display:none}
.sec[data-chrome="lean"] .sec-say{font-size:12px;line-height:1.22}
.sec[data-chrome="lean"] .sec-cap{display:none}
.sec[data-chrome="lean"] .sec-read .sec-k{font-size:12px}
.sec[data-chrome="lean"][data-layout="wide"] .sec-lbox{grid-template-columns:1fr}

/* ---------------- 打印：只出讲义图 ---------------- */
@media print{
  .sec-bar,.sec-read,.sec-ctrl,.sec-duo,.sec-cv,.sec-ov,.sec-ld,.sec-togs,.sec-apartbar,.sec-alarm{display:none !important}
  .sec{display:block;background:#fff;border-radius:0}
  .sec-stage{overflow:visible;min-height:0}
  .sec-sheet{position:static;display:block !important;overflow:visible}
  .sec-sheet svg{width:170mm}
}

uniform vec3 uCam; uniform vec3 uGas; uniform vec3 uMist;
uniform float uR; uniform float uY0; uniform float uY1; uniform float uTop; uniform float uDen; uniform float uMistDen; uniform float uTime;
varying vec3 vPos;
// 翻涌：几层不同方向、不同速度的正弦叠起来，当作便宜的体积噪声（确定性，不用随机数）
float swirl(vec3 p) {
  float a = sin(p.x * 210.0 + p.y * 90.0 + uTime * 0.8) * sin(p.z * 190.0 - p.y * 70.0 - uTime * 0.6);
  float b = sin(p.y * 260.0 - uTime * 1.1 + p.x * 120.0) * cos(p.z * 140.0 + uTime * 0.5);
  return 0.5 + 0.28 * a + 0.22 * b;
}
float dens(vec3 p) {
  float top = uTop + 0.006 * sin(p.x * 90.0 + uTime * 0.6) + 0.005 * cos(p.z * 110.0 - uTime * 0.5);
  float k = 1.0 - smoothstep(top - 0.03, top + 0.004, p.y);
  float h = clamp((p.y - uY0) / max(uTop - uY0, 0.001), 0.0, 1.0);
  float bottom = 0.55 + 1.1 * (1.0 - h) * (1.0 - h);
  return k * bottom * (0.55 + 0.9 * swirl(p));
}
void main() {
  vec3 ro = uCam, rd = normalize(vPos - uCam);
  // 射线与圆柱（半径 uR、y ∈ [uY0, uY1]）求出入点
  float a = dot(rd.xz, rd.xz), b = 2.0 * dot(ro.xz, rd.xz), c = dot(ro.xz, ro.xz) - uR * uR;
  float disc = b * b - 4.0 * a * c;
  if (disc <= 0.0 || a < 1e-8) discard;
  float sq = sqrt(disc);
  float t0 = (-b - sq) / (2.0 * a), t1 = (-b + sq) / (2.0 * a);
  float ty0 = (uY0 - ro.y) / rd.y, ty1 = (uY1 - ro.y) / rd.y;
  float tymin = min(ty0, ty1), tymax = max(ty0, ty1);
  t0 = max(max(t0, tymin), 0.0); t1 = min(t1, tymax);
  if (t1 <= t0) discard;
  float L = t1 - t0, tauG = 0.0, tauM = 0.0;
  for (int i = 0; i < 10; i++) {
    vec3 p = ro + rd * (t0 + (float(i) + 0.5) / 10.0 * L);
    float d = dens(p) * L / 10.0;
    float hm = clamp((p.y - uY0) / max(uY1 - uY0, 0.001), 0.0, 1.0);
    tauG += d * uDen; tauM += d * uMistDen * smoothstep(0.25, 0.75, hm) * (0.6 + 0.8 * swirl(p * 0.7));
  }
  float tau = tauG + tauM;
  float alpha = 1.0 - exp(-tau);
  if (alpha < 0.003) discard;
  vec3 colr = (uGas * tauG + uMist * tauM) / max(tau, 1e-5);
  gl_FragColor = vec4(colr, alpha);
  #include <tonemapping_fragment>
  #include <colorspace_fragment>
}

uniform sampler2D map; uniform sampler2D ramp; uniform vec3 sunDir; uniform float tint; uniform float landTint;
      uniform vec3 spotDir[2]; uniform float spotCos[2]; uniform vec3 spotCol[2]; uniform float spotK[2];
      varying vec2 vUv; varying vec3 vN; varying vec3 vL; varying vec3 vV;
      void main(){
        vec3 t = texture2D(map, vUv).rgb;
        float sea = smoothstep(0.04, 0.14, t.b - max(t.r, t.g * 0.92));
        vec3 c = mix(t, t * vec3(0.62, 0.78, 0.95), sea * 0.55);
        // 海面不是一色平涂：低频起伏 ±5 %（洋面明暗），水温着色时不加
        float sw = sin(vL.x * 9.0 + sin(vL.y * 7.0) * 1.7) * sin(vL.z * 8.0 + vL.y * 5.0);
        c *= 1.0 + sea * (1.0 - tint) * 0.05 * sw;
        vec3 rc = texture2D(ramp, vec2(0.5, vUv.y)).rgb;
        c = mix(c, rc, tint * mix(sea, 1.0, landTint) * 0.85);
        for (int i = 0; i < 2; i++) {
          float w = smoothstep(spotCos[i], spotCos[i] + 0.006, dot(vL, spotDir[i])) * (1.0 - sea) * spotK[i];
          c = mix(c, spotCol[i], w * 0.78);
        }
        float d = max(dot(normalize(vN), sunDir), 0.0);
        c *= 0.62 + 0.5 * d;
        // 主光在海面上的一处反光（引视线，水温着色时不加，免得改了色阶读数）+ 球缘一圈淡蓝大气（一直有，陆地着色前后一致）
        vec3 n = normalize(vN), v = normalize(vV);
        float glint = pow(max(dot(reflect(-sunDir, n), v), 0.0), 40.0) * sea;
        c += (1.0 - tint) * glint * vec3(0.30, 0.30, 0.26);
        float rim = pow(1.0 - max(dot(n, v), 0.0), 3.0);
        c = mix(c, vec3(0.80, 0.89, 0.97), rim * 0.35);
        gl_FragColor = vec4(c, 1.0);
        #include <tonemapping_fragment>
        #include <colorspace_fragment>
      }

uniform sampler2D map; uniform vec3 sunDir; uniform float nightK; uniform float zones; varying vec2 vUv; varying vec3 vN; varying vec3 vV;
      void main(){ vec3 t = texture2D(map, vUv).rgb;
        float lon = vUv.x * 360.0 - 180.0;
        float band = mod(floor((lon + 7.5) / 15.0), 2.0);
        t = mix(t, vec3(1.0), band * 0.22 * zones);
        float d = dot(normalize(vN), normalize(sunDir));
        vec3 dayC = t * (0.98 + 0.22 * max(d, 0.0));
        vec3 nightC = mix(t * 0.16, vec3(0.04, 0.07, 0.18), 0.5);
        float k = smoothstep(-0.035, 0.045, d);
        vec3 c = mix(mix(dayC, nightC, nightK), dayC, k);
        // 晨昏过渡带一点暖色、白天海面一处太阳反光、白天球缘一圈淡蓝大气（时区色带步不加反光）
        vec3 n = normalize(vN), v = normalize(vV), L = normalize(sunDir);
        c += k * (1.0 - k) * 4.0 * vec3(0.14, 0.05, -0.02);
        float sea = smoothstep(0.03, 0.14, t.b - max(t.r, t.g));
        c += (1.0 - zones) * sea * k * pow(max(dot(reflect(-L, n), v), 0.0), 60.0) * vec3(0.5, 0.46, 0.38);
        c = mix(c, vec3(0.62, 0.80, 1.0), pow(1.0 - max(dot(n, v), 0.0), 3.0) * (0.12 + 0.4 * k));
        gl_FragColor = vec4(c, 1.0);
        #include <tonemapping_fragment>
        #include <colorspace_fragment>
      }

precision highp float;
varying vec3 vWorld;
uniform vec3 uMin, uMax;
uniform float uTime, uLoad, uSeed;
uniform int uSteps;

float hash(vec3 p){ p = fract(p * 0.3183099 + 0.1); p *= 17.0; return fract(p.x * p.y * p.z * (p.x + p.y + p.z)); }
float noise(vec3 x){
  vec3 i = floor(x), f = fract(x); f = f * f * (3.0 - 2.0 * f);
  return mix(mix(mix(hash(i), hash(i + vec3(1,0,0)), f.x), mix(hash(i + vec3(0,1,0)), hash(i + vec3(1,1,0)), f.x), f.y),
             mix(mix(hash(i + vec3(0,0,1)), hash(i + vec3(1,0,1)), f.x), mix(hash(i + vec3(0,1,1)), hash(i + vec3(1,1,1)), f.x), f.y), f.z);
}
float fbm(vec3 p){ return 0.55 * noise(p) + 0.30 * noise(p * 2.03) + 0.15 * noise(p * 4.07); }

// 光线与盒子求交
vec2 boxHit(vec3 ro, vec3 rd){
  vec3 t0 = (uMin - ro) / rd, t1 = (uMax - ro) / rd;
  vec3 lo = min(t0, t1), hi = max(t0, t1);
  return vec2(max(max(lo.x, lo.y), lo.z), min(min(hi.x, hi.y), hi.z));
}

void main(){
  vec3 ro = cameraPosition;
  vec3 rd = normalize(vWorld - ro);
  vec2 h = boxHit(ro, rd);
  float t0 = max(h.x, 0.0), t1 = h.y;
  if (t1 <= t0) discard;
  int N = uSteps;
  float dt = (t1 - t0) / float(N);
  vec3 acc = vec3(0.0);
  float alpha = 0.0;
  for (int i = 0; i < 64; i++) {
    if (i >= N) break;
    float t = t0 + dt * (float(i) + 0.5);
    vec3 p = ro + rd * t;
    vec3 q = (p - uMin) / (uMax - uMin);                 // 0..1
    // 噪声往上滚 + invert()：原版 THREE.Fire 取的是「反过来」的噪声才起焰舌
    float rise = q.y - uTime * 0.55;
    float n = fbm(vec3(q.x * 6.0, rise * 4.2, q.z * 6.0) + uSeed);
    float m = 1.0 - n;
    float narrowX = 1.0 - pow(abs(q.x * 2.0 - 1.0), 2.6);   // 横向收成火舌
    float narrowZ = 1.0 - pow(abs(q.z * 2.0 - 1.0), 2.6);
    float taper = 1.0 - smoothstep(0.02, 1.0, q.y);        // 越高越淡
    float shape = smoothstep(0.24, 0.62, m * (0.42 + 0.58 * taper)) * narrowX * narrowZ;
    float d = clamp(shape * uLoad * 2.0, 0.0, 1.0);
    if (d <= 0.002) continue;
    // 程序化色带：底部预混（蓝）→ 中段（橙）→ 焰尖（亮黄），跟着高度而不是密度走
    vec3 cBlue = vec3(0.20, 0.46, 1.00);
    vec3 cMid  = vec3(1.00, 0.50, 0.10);
    vec3 cHot  = vec3(1.00, 0.94, 0.70);
    vec3 col = mix(cBlue, cMid, smoothstep(0.02, 0.34, q.y));
    col = mix(col, cHot, smoothstep(0.34, 0.88, q.y));
    float a = d * 0.34;
    acc += col * a * (1.0 - alpha);
    alpha += a * (1.0 - alpha);
  }
  if (alpha < 0.004) discard;
  gl_FragColor = vec4(acc / max(alpha, 1e-3), alpha);
}

uniform vec3 uColor; uniform float uTime, uW, uHi, uDim, uOpacity, uDash;
      varying vec2 vUv; varying float vFade; varying float vFace; varying vec3 vN;
      void main(){
        vec3 L = normalize(vec3(0.35, 0.55, 0.9));
        float lit = 0.80 + 0.22 * abs(dot(normalize(vN), L));
        vec3 col = uColor * lit;
        if (vFace > 0.5) {
          float e = min(vUv.x, 1.0 - vUv.x) * uW;                // 离边缘的世界距离
          col *= mix(0.62, 1.0, smoothstep(0.0, 0.08, e));       // 边缘深一档（浅背板上也看得清）
          float ch = fract((vUv.y - uTime * 0.9 - abs(vUv.x - 0.5) * min(uW, 2.0) * 0.5) / 2.4);
          col = mix(col, vec3(1.0), 0.11 * smoothstep(0.0, 0.1, ch) * (1.0 - smoothstep(0.16, 0.3, ch)));   // 沿流向移动的 V 纹
          if (uDash > 0.5) { float d = step(0.5, fract(vUv.y / 0.5)); col = mix(col, vec3(1.0), 0.45 * (1.0 - smoothstep(0.0, 0.09, e)) * d); }
        } else col *= 0.78;
        col = mix(col, vec3(1.0), 0.16 * uHi);
        float a = uOpacity * vFade * (1.0 - 0.65 * uDim);
        col = mix(col, vec3(dot(col, vec3(0.33))), 0.4 * uDim);
        gl_FragColor = vec4(col, a);
        #include <colorspace_fragment>
      }

uniform sampler2D map; uniform vec3 sunDir; uniform float uFlat; uniform float uZone; uniform float uMix; uniform float uSolo;
      uniform vec3 zT; uniform vec3 zW; uniform vec3 zC; uniform float trop; uniform float polar;
      varying vec2 vUv; varying vec3 vN; varying vec3 vV;
      void main(){
        vec3 t = texture2D(map, vUv).rgb;
        float lum = dot(t, vec3(0.2126, 0.7152, 0.0722));
        if (uSolo > 0.5) { t = vec3(0.3); lum = 0.3; }
        if (uMix > 0.999) lum = 0.3;                                         // 改坏开关 zone-cover：色带整块盖住底图
        float lit = smoothstep(-0.04, 0.22, dot(normalize(vN), sunDir));      // 晨昏线附近快速过渡
        float k = mix(0.34 + 0.74 * lit, 1.0, uFlat);                         // 夜半球压到约 1/3，大陆仍认得出
        float la = abs((vUv.y - 0.5) * 180.0);
        vec3 zc = la <= trop ? zT : (la < polar ? zW : zC);
        float sea = smoothstep(0.03, 0.14, t.b - max(t.r, t.g));            // 海面：蓝通道明显高
        if (uMix > 0.999) sea = 0.5;                                          // 改坏开关 zone-cover：陆海不分
        vec3 tinted = zc * mix(0.80, 1.06, sea) * (0.86 + 0.30 * lum);       // 平涂带色 + 陆地略深（图 1.18 的样子）
        vec3 c = mix(t, tinted, uZone * uMix) * k;
        // 有光照的步才加：晨昏线一条暖色过渡、白天海面一处太阳反光、白天球缘一圈淡蓝大气（五带步平光不加）
        float ld = (1.0 - uFlat) * (1.0 - uZone);
        vec3 n = normalize(vN), v = normalize(vV);
        float dusk = lit * (1.0 - lit) * 4.0;
        c += ld * dusk * vec3(0.16, 0.06, -0.02);
        float glint = pow(max(dot(reflect(-sunDir, n), v), 0.0), 60.0) * sea * lit;
        c += ld * glint * vec3(0.55, 0.5, 0.42);
        float rim = pow(1.0 - max(dot(n, v), 0.0), 3.0);
        c = mix(c, vec3(0.62, 0.80, 1.0), ld * rim * (0.15 + 0.45 * lit));
        gl_FragColor = vec4(c, 1.0);
        #include <tonemapping_fragment>
        #include <colorspace_fragment>
      }
